1
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:31,599
Within two hours,

2
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,680
we have to get out of here.

3
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,319
It's not that urgent.

4
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:35,280
Don't be nervous.

5
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,560
Still, we should be careful.

6
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,879
Go rest for a bit.

7
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:40,680
It's fine. It's safe here.

8
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:15,280
Your Highness, Prince Obida,

9
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:17,879
we're here on the King's orders to escort you.

10
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,520
Who is it?

11
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:33,560
People from my country. They're here to get me.

12
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,599
Are you sure?

13
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,439
I'm sure.

14
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,520
I don't need this anymore.

15
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,319
All right, let's go.

16
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,800
Go, let's move!

17
00:03:57,960 --> 00:04:00,199
Thank you for protecting Prince Obida.

18
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,800
Rosie.

19
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:08,919
From now on, whatever trouble you run into,

20
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,680
or whatever you need,

21
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,599
just call me at this number.

22
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,399
In return,

23
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,560
whether in my country

24
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,600
or in Supedo,

25
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,560
I'll unconditionally

26
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,199
grant you three wishes.

27
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,199
What if I have a wish right now?

28
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,120
Can it be granted right away?

29
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,000
Of course.

30
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:36,879
I want a car with a full tank of gas,

31
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:39,160
and a bottle of mineral water.

32
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,279
Let's count those two as just one.

33
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,240
Thank you.

34
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,480
Captain.

35
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:44,800
I'm already inside Libania.

36
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,720
Following Wei Tian's instructions,

37
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:48,800
I'm heading to the designated location,

38
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,519
and I can track down José Limón.

39
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,279
Got it, Rosie.

40
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,720
I just got off the plane with the Zhong An team.

41
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:57,079
Make sure you stay safe.

42
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:58,439
Don't worry.

43
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,480
I just saved this country's Crown Prince,

44
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:04,560
and even got a card good for any favor.

45
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,120
Did you see that?

46
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,879
Talk about good timing, huh?

47
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,199
Right now,

48
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,480
the terrorist forces from Supedo

49
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,120
have already infiltrated Libania.

50
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,720
They're even trying to kidnap

51
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,560
this country's Crown Prince, Obida,

52
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,480
to threaten this country

53
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:35,279
into withholding aid from the King of Supedo.

54
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:37,600
You have to stay safe.

55
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:40,199
Alright, I'm relatively safe here.

56
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,480
Once you find Wei Tian,

57
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,519
remember to contact me.

58
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,480
Rosie, what's going on over there?

59
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:12,800
Are you okay?

60
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,120
Can you walk?

61
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,519
Hurry!

62
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,800
Watch out!

63
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,720
It's all my fault. Earlier,

64
00:08:58,919 --> 00:09:01,320
I wasn't focused on driving.

65
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,519
I'm sorry. It's all on me.

66
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,279
Don't worry.

67
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:10,600
I'll definitely get you to safety.

68
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,120
Thank you.

69
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,519
Don't mention it.

70
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:19,279
A very brave person once

71
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:21,360
saved my life without hesitation.

72
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:31,080
Qin Huan, get in!

73
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:37,799
Qin Huan!

74
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,519
You're safe now.

75
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,080
The paramedics are on their way.

76
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,200
You can get out and leave now.

77
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:47,879
I want to rest here for a bit.

78
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,559
Thank you. Are you all right?

79
00:10:50,879 --> 00:10:52,200
I'll go find the paramedics.

80
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,519
You're awake, Your Majesty.

81
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:31,000
How long was I asleep?

82
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,039
Not long.

83
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,919
Here, have some water first.

84
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:37,240
Thank you.

85
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,080
You're welcome.

86
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,120
Your Majesty...

87
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:50,679
The news that you'll attend the show,

88
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:52,519
I've already had people spread it.

89
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:54,600
Everyone now believes

90
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:56,720
their King hasn't been captured.

91
00:11:56,799 --> 00:11:58,320
The rumor has already been dispelled,

92
00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:00,679
so I don't think

93
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,159
there's any need for you

94
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,480
to take this risk in person.

95
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:06,080
They only want José Limón alive.

96
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:08,759
If I die at their hands,

97
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,120
the people of Supedo won't forgive them.

98
00:12:11,639 --> 00:12:14,519
They just want me to publicly admit fault

99
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:17,120
and repeal the reform policies.

100
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,799
But right now, Walter

101
00:12:19,799 --> 00:12:21,600
has already rallied other forces.

102
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,919
If you actually go to the theater,

103
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:24,720
we'll be exposed while they're in the dark.

104
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,799
That puts us at a huge disadvantage.

105
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:30,320
I'm definitely going.

106
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,759
Dad.

107
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,879
You called just in time.

108
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:51,080
I just received word

109
00:12:51,399 --> 00:12:54,720
that the situation in Antilocaris is chaotic.

110
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:55,960
What's going on?

111
00:12:57,279 --> 00:12:58,480
It went relatively well, I guess.

112
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,919
What do you mean, "relatively well"?

113
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:04,600
According to our men stationed in Africa,

114
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,279
Wei Tian, while protecting King José Limón,

115
00:13:09,759 --> 00:13:11,120
has now gone missing.

116
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,000
Did you send people to look for him?

117
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:15,960
We did, but there's no trace of him.

118
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,120
Also, Dad...

119
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,919
Helen is missing too.

120
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:26,000
And this is what you call "relatively well"?!

121
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,200
Dad...

122
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,320
Listen to me.

123
00:13:29,399 --> 00:13:30,960
Until Helen is found,

124
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:33,080
as the acting head,

125
00:13:33,679 --> 00:13:36,519
organize a team immediately and keep searching.

126
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,519
You must find Helen.

127
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,320
I know her capabilities.

128
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:42,000
There's no way she left nothing behind

129
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,279
and just vanished into thin air.

130
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,360
Understood.

131
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:47,759
Also, keep looking for Wei Tian.

132
00:13:49,559 --> 00:13:51,080
I don't believe he's dead.

133
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:55,480
You must believe that just as firmly as I do.

134
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:56,519
Did you hear me?

135
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,720
Yes, understood.

136
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:01,919
Good. That's all.

137
00:14:25,399 --> 00:14:26,759
So, Mr. Xiao said

138
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:27,919
to delegate this matter.

139
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:28,919
Anda!

140
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:29,720
Sister Anda!

141
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:32,919
Anda, why did you come alone?

142
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:34,679
You should've called the hotel for a car.

143
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:36,080
It's so dangerous outside!

144
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,519
It's fine. It's not my first time here.

145
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:40,559
Besides, I know you're short-handed.

146
00:14:40,799 --> 00:14:43,600
Plus, after that crane mix-up last time,

147
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,279
you might still be cursing me.

148
00:14:45,279 --> 00:14:47,759
No way, I'm not that kind of person!

149
00:14:48,279 --> 00:14:49,159
Look at you.

150
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:50,399
You just got back to China.

151
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:51,720
Why were you transferred back already?

152
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:53,120
Was it that she-devil Danfeng

153
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,159
stirring up trouble again?

154
00:14:54,399 --> 00:14:55,240
No, not at all.

155
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,279
Aren't you happy I'm back?

156
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,519
Of course I am! I've been missing you.

157
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:01,919
Then you must've summoned me back.

158
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:03,879
Well, that's wonderful.

159
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:06,080
By the way, where's Mr. Xiao?

160
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:09,279
I heard he kept clamoring to come back,

161
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:11,120
saying the pay is better here.

162
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:12,720
Right, right.

163
00:15:13,159 --> 00:15:14,960
He took sick leave these past two days, though.

164
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,360
Oh right, headquarters said

165
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,639
while he's away,

166
00:15:17,639 --> 00:15:19,600
you'll take over his duties.

167
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:24,080
Sick leave? What's he sick with?

168
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:24,919
Is it serious?

169
00:15:25,919 --> 00:15:26,679
Well...

170
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:28,080
Who knows if he's really sick?

171
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,919
He won't let us visit him at home.

172
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,480
Everyone suspects

173
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,039
his wife beat him up,

174
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:34,080
so he's afraid to go outside.

175
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,279
Alright, let him rest up at home then.

176
00:15:37,799 --> 00:15:38,519
Let's go.

177
00:15:38,519 --> 00:15:39,159
Let's go.

178
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:47,080
Tomorrow night,

179
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,720
we hope the honorable King José Limón

180
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:52,200
will show up and give everyone an explanation.

181
00:15:56,639 --> 00:15:57,440
Come in.

182
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,720
Xiang Bei, something happened to Rosie!

183
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,639
Something happened to Rosie?

184
00:16:02,639 --> 00:16:03,279
Yes.

185
00:16:03,399 --> 00:16:04,559
While I was on the phone with her,

186
00:16:04,559 --> 00:16:06,200
I heard an explosion on her end,

187
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,799
and then I couldn't reach her anymore.

188
00:16:07,919 --> 00:16:08,919
Also, look at this.

189
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,399
She sent a photo.

190
00:16:11,399 --> 00:16:12,720
I have to go to Libania.

191
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:15,159
Let me send someone with you.

192
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:17,080
No, no, no. I'll go alone.

193
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:19,039
But, Wei Tian...

194
00:16:19,039 --> 00:16:20,039
Leave things here to me.

195
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:21,440
I'm sure the two of them will be fine.

196
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,080
Okay.

197
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:36,879
Xiang Bei,

198
00:16:36,879 --> 00:16:39,159
Shen Yu, King José Limón

199
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,559
will appear at the theater tonight.

200
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:41,480
I think this is a great chance

201
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,799
to find Wei Tian and Helen.

202
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:44,559
Tell everyone to be ready to move.

203
00:16:44,919 --> 00:16:45,720
Understood.

204
00:16:46,039 --> 00:16:47,720
Also, remind everyone:

205
00:16:47,919 --> 00:16:49,919
today's mission is to protect King José Limón,

206
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,960
but try to avoid getting into

207
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,679
a confrontation with the militants.

208
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,519
Our main priority is finding Helen and Wei Tian.

209
00:17:03,679 --> 00:17:05,759
Anda, what are you doing here?

210
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,440
Our Plato Hotel and your Zhong An

211
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,559
have an agreement, after all.

212
00:17:09,559 --> 00:17:10,720
My name is currently on

213
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:12,920
the VIP guest list of Antilocaris.

214
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:16,319
I haven't been back to the Plato in a while.

215
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,400
There's an urgent mission going on.

216
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:22,799
Does your urgent mission have to do with him?

217
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,000
I'm... I'm asking you.

218
00:17:28,279 --> 00:17:29,759
Does it have to do with Wei Tian?

219
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:36,960
So what happened to him...

220
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,200
you don't believe it either, do you?

221
00:17:41,599 --> 00:17:43,079
Just focus on your work at the hotel.

222
00:17:43,359 --> 00:17:44,960
If the mission team at the hotel

223
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,039
falls short in any way,

224
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:47,000
let me know anytime.

225
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:50,079
No, let me join the mission.

226
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,759
Tell me what's going on.

227
00:17:51,759 --> 00:17:53,279
If I can help, I definitely will.

228
00:17:53,799 --> 00:17:55,920
Even if I can't help right now,

229
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:56,680
I swear

230
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,880
I'll follow your orders.

231
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:58,759
I won't step out of line.

232
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,960
Just do your job at the hotel

233
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,440
and don't worry about anything.

234
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,920
That would be the biggest help to me.

235
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,559
I promise you, I'll be fine.

236
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,000
Don't worry.

237
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,839
I'll bring Wei Tian back safely,

238
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:18,680
standing right in front of you without a scratch.

239
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,440
That's... that's not enough!

240
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:25,160
Is that really all Zhong An can do?

241
00:18:28,279 --> 00:18:30,599
I want both you and Wei Tian

242
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:33,319
to stand before me safe and sound.

243
00:18:35,799 --> 00:18:37,160
All right, I promise you.

244
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,880
We need to control here, and here.

245
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,359
Focus deployment on the auditorium.

246
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:24,640
Sir.

247
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:28,000
His Majesty wasn't spotted at the theater entrance.

248
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,319
Are you sure?

249
00:19:29,519 --> 00:19:30,319
Yes.

250
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,880
King José Limón will definitely be there.

251
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,599
I told you.

252
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:40,400
Your approach is too soft. It doesn't work.

253
00:19:41,039 --> 00:19:41,839
Well?

254
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:44,480
Ready to go with my plan now?

255
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:47,000
Hades, I don't care what you do,

256
00:19:47,279 --> 00:19:49,279
you must guarantee the King's safety.

257
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:50,359
That's non-negotiable.

258
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:53,160
Only a living, reigning king

259
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,559
holds any value.

260
00:19:54,559 --> 00:19:56,359
Watch out for the people around him.

261
00:19:56,359 --> 00:19:57,680
That's your job.

262
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,519
Don't worry.

263
00:19:59,279 --> 00:20:00,079
I also want to know

264
00:20:00,079 --> 00:20:02,079
who rescued the King that day.

265
00:20:02,319 --> 00:20:03,559
She must still be around.

266
00:21:36,039 --> 00:21:38,319
Hello, ladies and gentlemen.

267
00:21:39,559 --> 00:21:42,960
Welcome to the Antilocaris Theater.

268
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:45,000
Before the performance begins,

269
00:21:45,079 --> 00:21:48,519
I would like to extend my gratitude

270
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,079
to everyone in attendance,

271
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:54,599
especially to one very special guest,

272
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,079
and that is our

273
00:21:57,240 --> 00:22:00,279
esteemed King José Limón.

274
00:22:27,359 --> 00:22:29,559
Let the performance officially begin.

275
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,720
You don't need to be so nervous.

276
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:40,759
You saw how everyone reacted just now.

277
00:23:41,039 --> 00:23:42,480
Even if they come,

278
00:23:42,599 --> 00:23:44,119
they won't do anything to me.

279
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,480
But if Walter

280
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,920
has really joined forces with Hades,

281
00:23:48,119 --> 00:23:49,759
things won't be that simple.

282
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,720
Don't worry, though.

283
00:23:52,319 --> 00:23:54,079
I've already checked the escape route.

284
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,960
And remember what I told you earlier:

285
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,759
no matter what happens,

286
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,279
you must follow my instructions.

287
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:56,079
Secure the entrance.

288
00:24:56,119 --> 00:24:57,160
Starting now,

289
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:58,599
no one goes in or out.

290
00:24:58,599 --> 00:24:59,240
Copy that!

291
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:01,200
Remember, the target is the King.

292
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:01,920
Move out!

293
00:25:22,079 --> 00:25:22,920
Move!

294
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:39,799
Don't move! Nobody move!

295
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,440
Get out!

296
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:46,039
Get down! Don't move!

297
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:47,279
Don't move! Stay still!

298
00:25:47,519 --> 00:25:48,319
Everyone, get out!

299
00:25:49,359 --> 00:25:50,519
Hurry up! Get out!

300
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:52,799
Move it, get out!

301
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:55,119
Hurry! Faster!

302
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,599
Get out! Move!

303
00:25:59,519 --> 00:26:00,279
Quick!

304
00:26:04,319 --> 00:26:06,279
Sir, no sign of His Majesty the King.

305
00:26:06,319 --> 00:26:07,880
What about the guard protecting the King?

306
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:08,720
Haven't seen him.

307
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:10,400
Search every corner of this area!

308
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,079
Yes, sir!

309
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:26,240
Move!

310
00:26:36,359 --> 00:26:37,160
Dressing Room

311
00:26:41,799 --> 00:26:42,680
Your Majesty

312
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:04,000
Your Majesty, I believe this dressing room

313
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:05,519
is the safest place right now.

314
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:08,200
Those were likely Hades' men just now.

315
00:27:08,559 --> 00:27:10,599
He teamed up with Walter to seize the theater.

316
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:14,279
I used a jammer

317
00:27:14,279 --> 00:27:16,160
to disrupt the security camera feeds,

318
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,319
but it won't hold for long.

319
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:20,079
They'll probably track us down shortly.

320
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,759
Whatever happens,

321
00:27:21,839 --> 00:27:24,200
you can't let me fall into Walter's hands.

322
00:27:25,359 --> 00:27:27,000
If they do catch me,

323
00:27:28,119 --> 00:27:29,559
please do this for me.

324
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:39,079
Your Majesty,

325
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:41,119
I won't let you fall into their hands.

326
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,279
Please trust me.

327
00:27:56,319 --> 00:27:57,319
Who's the manager?

328
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:01,599
Who's the manager?

329
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:08,119
Bring him up.

330
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:09,960
Move.

331
00:28:11,599 --> 00:28:12,400
Quick.

332
00:28:14,519 --> 00:28:15,319
Get up there.

333
00:28:22,559 --> 00:28:23,799
Where's the surveillance room?

334
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:25,759
Take me there.

335
00:28:26,599 --> 00:28:27,400
Hurry.

336
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,440
Hurry up.

337
00:28:30,759 --> 00:28:31,559
Move.

338
00:28:41,759 --> 00:28:42,599
Your Majesty

339
00:29:12,119 --> 00:29:13,359
Our car is registered.

340
00:29:13,759 --> 00:29:14,960
Don't do anything reckless.

341
00:29:21,799 --> 00:29:23,000
IDs, please.

342
00:29:23,799 --> 00:29:24,880
Mine or the car's?

343
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:25,599
All of them.

344
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:28,799
What's your business?

345
00:29:30,319 --> 00:29:31,160
Security mission.

346
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:32,200
It's locked down up ahead.

347
00:29:32,200 --> 00:29:32,920
Don't worry.

348
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:34,880
Half the city's armed forces are there.

349
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,400
We don't need a security company.

350
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:37,920
But...

351
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,000
No buts.

352
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:41,200
Turn back now if you don't want to get shot.

353
00:29:43,319 --> 00:29:44,119
Move it.

354
00:29:51,839 --> 00:29:52,920
Are we just leaving like this?

355
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,680
Didn't you hear what they said?

356
00:29:54,680 --> 00:29:55,799
Do you want to get shot?

357
00:29:58,559 --> 00:30:00,160
What about the King and Helen now?

358
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,279
We'll support them from the outside.

359
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,599
I actually hope we can't find them.

360
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,519
Because if even the two of us can't,

361
00:30:06,519 --> 00:30:07,359
then those idiots

362
00:30:07,359 --> 00:30:08,920
won't stand a chance.

363
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:31,200
Zoom in here.

364
00:30:35,839 --> 00:30:37,400
So it's Zhong An.

365
00:30:38,279 --> 00:30:39,119
Interesting.

366
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:46,279
The theater is under our control.

367
00:30:46,279 --> 00:30:47,079
Any second now...

368
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,279
What?

369
00:30:53,759 --> 00:30:54,559
Understood.

370
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:00,480
Your commander gave an order.

371
00:31:00,559 --> 00:31:01,920
No shooting in the theater.

372
00:31:03,519 --> 00:31:04,319
Move!

373
00:31:05,559 --> 00:31:06,359
Hurry!

374
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,359
Quick, take cover!

375
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,400
Your Majesty, open the door.

376
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,519
This way.

377
00:32:13,119 --> 00:32:13,920
Move.

378
00:32:27,519 --> 00:32:30,680
Stop running. You can't get away.

379
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:43,720
Come out.

380
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,119
You can't hide.

381
00:32:56,119 --> 00:32:57,519
Damn this smoke.

382
00:32:58,160 --> 00:32:58,960
Move.

383
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:16,480
Come on, take my hand.

384
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:20,480
Careful.

385
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:31,680
Follow me.

386
00:33:32,480 --> 00:33:33,799
Hello, please help me.

387
00:33:33,799 --> 00:33:34,960
I won't hurt you.

388
00:33:35,119 --> 00:33:35,920
Okay.

389
00:33:36,119 --> 00:33:37,680
Let's go. Thank you.

390
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:38,880
Move, hurry!

391
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:07,720
All set.

392
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:33,280
Sir, we lost them.

393
00:34:33,519 --> 00:34:34,960
That tunnel leads to the street.

394
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,360
The King wasn't spotted nearby either,

395
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:37,480
nor was his guard.

396
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:38,199
Shut up!

397
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:40,199
Sir, what about these people?

398
00:34:40,559 --> 00:34:41,760
What do we do with them?

399
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:44,480
Don't ask me. Ask your commander.

400
00:34:47,280 --> 00:34:48,159
Don't ask me!

401
00:34:52,079 --> 00:34:54,280
We interrupt for breaking news.

402
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,920
Wanted: Helen.

403
00:34:56,039 --> 00:34:57,400
Female, 26 years old.

404
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:59,760
Operations Captain, Zhong An Africa Branch.

405
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:01,639
Around 21:00 last night,

406
00:35:01,639 --> 00:35:03,880
at the Antilocaris Theater,

407
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:06,119
she kidnapped King José Limón.

408
00:35:06,679 --> 00:35:07,800
Nonsense!

409
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:12,280
My whereabouts are exposed now,

410
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:14,320
and Zhong An has been dragged into this, too.

411
00:35:14,440 --> 00:35:15,719
I want to apologize to you.

412
00:35:16,199 --> 00:35:17,000
Why?

413
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:19,400
I anticipated today's situation long ago.

414
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:23,360
That's why you rushed the deals with Sino-Harbor and Zhong An.

415
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,400
You figured it out?

416
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,000
I wasn't sure before,

417
00:35:27,039 --> 00:35:27,920
but I am now.

418
00:35:28,119 --> 00:35:29,360
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

419
00:35:29,639 --> 00:35:31,400
Since I've taken on this mission,

420
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:32,280
and Zhong An

421
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:33,719
has already been dragged in,

422
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:35,920
I'll do everything to protect you.

423
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:37,599
Yet I'm not sure

424
00:35:37,599 --> 00:35:39,079
if we can get through the airport

425
00:35:39,079 --> 00:35:40,480
and leave Antilocaris safely.

426
00:35:40,519 --> 00:35:42,559
Let's find a safe place first

427
00:35:42,559 --> 00:35:44,000
and decide based on how things go.

428
00:35:44,719 --> 00:35:46,480
I know a good place to hide.

429
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:48,000
Here's the plan. We'll head there first,

430
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:49,719
then I'll have Zhong An's team

431
00:35:49,719 --> 00:35:50,800
come meet us.

432
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:53,079
Also, stay close to me.

433
00:35:53,239 --> 00:35:54,400
Whatever you do, don't get spotted.

434
00:35:55,239 --> 00:35:56,039
Let's go.

435
00:35:56,039 --> 00:35:56,679
Move.

436
00:35:58,480 --> 00:36:00,679
We interrupt for breaking news.

437
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:02,280
Wanted: Helen.

438
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,760
Female, 26 years old.

439
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:06,360
Operations Captain, Zhong An Africa Branch.

440
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:08,920
Around 21:00 last night,

441
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:11,000
at the Antilocaris Theater,

442
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:12,320
she kidnapped King José Limón.

443
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,119
How is this possible?

444
00:36:13,639 --> 00:36:15,679
This warrant is nationwide.

445
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:22,679
Three operational teams...

446
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:26,079
How big is Antilocaris anyway?

447
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:28,400
How many streets surround a single theater?

448
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:30,320
Yet they can't even find a few people!

449
00:36:31,039 --> 00:36:31,920
And now look at this.

450
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,880
The whole country is searching for the King.

451
00:36:34,679 --> 00:36:35,480
Even Helen's identity

452
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:36,599
has been fully exposed.

453
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,119
We don't need to worry about that.

454
00:36:39,760 --> 00:36:41,760
Even if we open our doors and let them search,

455
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:42,760
those terrorists

456
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:44,079
wouldn't dare lay a finger on us.

457
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:46,119
I'm not worried about Zhong An.

458
00:36:46,679 --> 00:36:48,320
I'm worried about Helen and the King.

459
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,599
If anything happens to them,

460
00:36:49,599 --> 00:36:50,719
we'll be in serious trouble.

461
00:36:53,039 --> 00:36:55,360
Now Shalan of the Silent Protectors is dead,

462
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:57,679
Wei Tian and Rosie are missing,

463
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:59,320
and even Captain isn't around.

464
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:02,320
I don't think we need to worry about Wei Tian.

465
00:37:02,679 --> 00:37:04,320
Because if he wants to stay hidden,

466
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:05,519
nobody can find him.

467
00:37:06,440 --> 00:37:07,920
What about Rosie, though?

468
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:10,679
We can only wait for word from Captain.

469
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:15,079
Right now,

470
00:37:15,079 --> 00:37:17,119
Walter and Hades' men are everywhere.

471
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,800
We can barely move an inch.

472
00:37:20,159 --> 00:37:21,400
How are things over at Plato Hotel?

473
00:37:21,719 --> 00:37:22,960
I've already sent people there.

474
00:37:23,239 --> 00:37:24,679
Everything is normal for now.

475
00:37:24,679 --> 00:37:25,480
Good.

476
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:53,679
What's this?

477
00:37:54,119 --> 00:37:55,679
It's my family's mark.

478
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,719
Looks like someone's here to welcome us.

479
00:37:58,679 --> 00:37:59,599
Are you sure?

480
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,440
Because this looks...

481
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,800
like it was just drawn.

482
00:38:03,239 --> 00:38:05,199
It must be someone from my family.

483
00:38:05,239 --> 00:38:08,480
And they're showing us the way.

484
00:38:10,679 --> 00:38:12,000
Tell you what, Your Majesty.

485
00:38:12,199 --> 00:38:13,159
You stay right here.

486
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:14,159
Don't wander off anywhere.

487
00:38:14,519 --> 00:38:15,719
I'll go check up ahead.

488
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:32,920
These are photos from the scene of Rosie's attack,

489
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:35,119
as well as the belongings she left behind.

490
00:38:36,639 --> 00:38:37,639
In accordance with

491
00:38:37,639 --> 00:38:39,360
Libania's highest honors,

492
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,400
we have laid her to rest.

493
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:43,000
Mr. Qu Shengli, please accept our condolences.

494
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:13,760
Have they found the killer?

495
00:39:16,239 --> 00:39:17,880
It was the ones who infiltrated our country—

496
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:21,159
Supedo terrorists trying to kidnap me.

497
00:39:21,719 --> 00:39:23,559
Rosie was trying to protect me,

498
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:25,760
and that's why they targeted her.

499
00:39:27,559 --> 00:39:29,320
I am truly sorry.

500
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:30,800
I...

501
00:39:33,639 --> 00:39:35,000
Hades again.

502
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,719
Don't worry.

503
00:39:37,239 --> 00:39:39,199
I will never let them get away with this.

504
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:40,800
If necessary,

505
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:43,960
we'll deploy troops to assist Supedo

506
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:45,559
in crushing these terrorists.

507
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:50,719
I won't let them off either.

508
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:01,559
Can I help you?

509
00:40:01,559 --> 00:40:02,760
What's your name?

510
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:03,719
I'm Rosie.

511
00:40:04,039 --> 00:40:05,000
You know how to fix cars?

512
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:08,159
Take it easy. She's my baby.

513
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:11,119
It's a sports car, so treat her right.

514
00:40:14,719 --> 00:40:15,480
Don't move!

515
00:40:16,159 --> 00:40:16,960
Nobody move!

516
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:19,000
Hand over all the cash!

517
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,559
We have to get out of here.

518
00:40:20,559 --> 00:40:21,480
The things here...

519
00:40:22,000 --> 00:40:23,519
might expose my identity.

520
00:40:28,039 --> 00:40:28,840
Let's go.

521
00:40:34,519 --> 00:40:35,760
I'm sorry, Rosie.

522
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:38,320
I dragged you into danger with me.

523
00:40:42,079 --> 00:40:43,800
To repay you for fixing my car,

524
00:40:44,159 --> 00:40:45,760
I can grant you one request.

525
00:40:45,880 --> 00:40:47,800
Plus, I'll give you a car.

526
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:56,760
Obida, are you okay?

527
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:00,760
Rosie, whenever you run into trouble,

528
00:41:00,760 --> 00:41:02,199
just call me at this number.

529
00:41:02,840 --> 00:41:03,960
Unconditionally,

530
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:05,960
I will grant you three wishes.

531
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:11,199
I want a car with a full tank of gas,

532
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:13,400
and a bottle of mineral water.

533
00:41:17,239 --> 00:41:20,079
Wei Tian, Rosie, Shalan...

534
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:21,599
Don't worry.

535
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,519
Even if only one person remains,

536
00:41:23,679 --> 00:41:25,199
the Silent Protectors will live on.

537
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:27,719
Even if I must fight to the very end,

538
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:31,719
I'll make sure justice stays on this land.

539
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:33,719
Drinking water is just like handling business.

540
00:41:34,440 --> 00:41:36,079
Things that shouldn't be mixed together

541
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:38,320
must never be combined.

542
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:43,400
You just don't want to join Zhong An, do you?

543
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:47,119
I'll email him back right away.

544
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:49,280
He must check in with us regularly.

545
00:41:49,760 --> 00:41:51,280
He wants to go alone.

546
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:54,159
We'll rush right back

547
00:41:54,199 --> 00:41:55,760
and dig him out even if we tear the place apart.

548
00:41:57,039 --> 00:41:58,920
Wei Tian is deliberately sending us away.

549
00:41:58,920 --> 00:42:00,119
He wants to act on his own.

550
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:01,199
You mean...

551
00:42:01,559 --> 00:42:03,519
José Limón isn't in Libania?

552
00:42:04,519 --> 00:42:05,880
But what if it's true?

553
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:08,360
That's why you should go to Libania,

554
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:10,079
and I'll go to Antilocaris.

555
00:42:10,400 --> 00:42:11,199
Okay.

556
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:15,119
Rosie, I've failed you.

557
00:42:15,840 --> 00:42:18,920
I shouldn't have let you come to Libania alone.

558
00:42:19,719 --> 00:42:21,880
I should've let you stay like before,

559
00:42:22,519 --> 00:42:25,719
traveling the world doing what you love,

560
00:42:26,559 --> 00:42:27,880
completely carefree.

561
00:42:38,679 --> 00:42:39,480
Your Majesty,

562
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:42,079
there really are a few identical marks up ahead,

563
00:42:42,199 --> 00:42:43,719
though they're all freshly made.

564
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:46,199
Are you really sure you recognize this symbol?

565
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,239
There's no mistake.

566
00:42:47,239 --> 00:42:48,519
It must be someone from my family.

567
00:42:48,519 --> 00:42:50,679
Only three people know this symbol.

568
00:42:52,440 --> 00:42:53,239
Alright then.

569
00:42:53,679 --> 00:42:55,320
